        "payload": "tree 623048d77e266fc070a786da5b0eba284e42e82e\nparent 22245aedf4000e62b597d40091a23388f2fa533a\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1791674019 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1791674019 +0200\n\nmusig: Clear secrets before ARG_CHECK failures in partial_sign\n\nsecp256k1_musig_partial_sign loads the secnonce scalars into stack\nvariables and zeroes the secnonce, so those copies are the only ones\nleft. The ARG_CHECKs after that point return without calling\nsecp256k1_musig_partial_sign_clear, which leaves the nonce scalars on\nthe stack. Clear them before the check fails.\n\nAssisted-by: my usual tools (LLM, Internet, computer). Mistakes are mine.\nSigned-off-by: Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net>\n",
